    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Tired; fever only at the start</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Positive</td><td>Productive cough; no breathlessness or wheeze</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Positive</td><td>Aching along the chest scar with hard coughing; no exertional pain or palpitations</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Sore throat and runny nose, settling</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood steady; no thoughts of harming himself</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

